  id: grand_incubator
  displayName: Grand Incubator
  description: 'A crystal-heated incubator ringed with nests: warms 5 eggs at once
    and takes waiting eggs from camp storage by itself whenever a place frees up.
    Pair kin and hatch eggs here too. Replaces the Brood House.'
